//! tr kodlu 3 dil=en
// Error 16 — Calling something that is not a function.
// Message code: H2421
// What happens: Calling a value that is not a function raises an error at run time.
// Why: x is an Int; an Int cannot be called like a function.
// Fixed version:
//     func x() {
//         return 5
//     }
//     print(x())
// Run (from the project root): tr examples/en/errors/16_not_a_function.tr   (exit code 1)

TR_kw_var x = 5
x()
